  The design patterns of the Gate (answer a cancelled or failed model
  request as an empty completed response and mute requests that only
  answer cancelled work), the coordinator scheduling mirror used to detect
  the end of an ACP turn, and the parked cancel follow bough's Unreal Agent
  integration notes (go/docs/unreal-engine.md). No bough source code is
  included; the acp-unreal code was written independently.
